UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Eden Beauty Collection is a hair and beauty salon at 6A Kromboom Road in Rondebosch, Cape Town. Its services include hair styling, hair extensions, laser hair removal, manicures and pedicures, gel nails, waxing and threading. Lash services cover classic, hybrid and volume lashes, along with lamination and lift treatments.

